		(descr "Infineon IM72D128V01 (PG-LLGA-5-3, 4x3x1.2mm), bottom port. Land pattern per IM72D128V01 datasheet v1.01 Fig.13: pins 1/2 (DATA/VDD) share a column, 3/4 (CLOCK/SELECT) the other; pin 5 = copper GND ring R0.58-R1.04 around the 0.8mm sound port. Corrected 2026-10-16 (pads 2/3 were swapped; pin-5 ring copper was missing; 3D model was PG-LLGA-5-4 and offset). Footprint origin is 0.41mm from the package centre and 1.09mm from the port; the port is at (1.09, 0).")
